(75, 'com_content.article.39', '', '2024-10-11 22:35:19', 994, 3628, '4de6d6daa48edcf3e685a1c3377ee8aeb7ab1471', '{\"id\":\"39\",\"asset_id\":162,\"title\":\"Recuperando nascentes para um futuro mais sustent\\u00e1vel\",\"alias\":\"recuperando-nascentes-para-um-futuro-mais-sustentavel\",\"introtext\":\"<p>O cuidado com o meio ambiente sempre esteve entre as prioridades do cooperativismo. Independentemente do ramo, organiza\\u00e7\\u00f5es cooperativas pautam seu trabalho pela responsabilidade social e sustentabilidade.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>No estado de Mato Grosso, o Sicredi Sul MT arrega\\u00e7ou as mangas para, em um ano, recuperar e proteger 12 nascentes que desaguam nos rios afluentes de Cuiab\\u00e1 . Para tanto, a cooperativa investiu no reflorestamento das \\u00e1reas de prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o permanente pr\\u00f3ximas \\u00e0s fontes de \\u00e1gua e no isolamento dessas \\u00e1reas com cercas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cerca de 60 colaboradores se prontificaram a atuar como volunt\\u00e1rios no in\\u00edcio do projeto. Ao ver o impacto dessa a\\u00e7\\u00e3o na comunidade, rapidamente esse n\\u00famero chegou a mais de 150 pessoas, que dedicam um s\\u00e1bado por m\\u00eas para cuidar do meio ambiente.<br>E vale destacar: se as nascentes da regi\\u00e3o continuassem sendo assoreadas, haveria uma sens\\u00edvel diminui\\u00e7\\u00e3o da vaz\\u00e3o da \\u00e1gua, tornando esse recurso escasso ou at\\u00e9 mesmo impr\\u00f3prio para o consumo humano. Com o percurso das \\u00e1guas sendo redirecionado para a bacia, a quantidade de \\u00e1gua \\u00e9 maior, o que melhora o abastecimento na regi\\u00e3o como um todo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>As a\\u00e7\\u00f5es da cooperativa p\\u00f5em em pr\\u00e1tica o s\\u00e9timo princ\\u00edpio cooperativista de aten\\u00e7\\u00e3o pela comunidade: todos os habitantes do estado s\\u00e3o beneficiados com as a\\u00e7\\u00f5es ambientais desenvolvidas, presenciando uma melhora significativa na qualidade e disponibilidade da \\u00e1gua. Al\\u00e9m disso, a participa\\u00e7\\u00e3o das fam\\u00edlias volunt\\u00e1rias favorece a educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental de jovens e crian\\u00e7as da regi\\u00e3o.<\\/p>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 22:34:14\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-11 22:35:19\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-11 22:34:47\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 22:34:14\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1677432955-scaled-800x420.jpeg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1677432955-scaled-800x420.jpeg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":3,\"ordering\":0,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"*\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0);
