e9cnicos da Cocari em visita \\u00e0s propriedades ou diretamente nas Unidades da Cocari.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>O Projeto Olho D\\u2019\\u00c1gua tem recebido diversos pr\\u00eamios pela contribui\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental. Em 2014, foi apresentado no Minist\\u00e9rio da Agricultura, em Bras\\u00edlia, como refer\\u00eancia em publica\\u00e7\\u00e3o que elencou as a\\u00e7\\u00f5es ambientais mais importantes em andamento no Brasil naquele ano. A a\\u00e7\\u00e3o tamb\\u00e9m recebe o Selo Chico Mendes desde 2014 e conquistou o Trof\\u00e9u Cooperativa do Ano, em premia\\u00e7\\u00e3o da Organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o das Cooperativas Brasileiras (OCB). Em 2019, recebeu o trof\\u00e9u Onda Verde \\u2013 Pr\\u00eamio Express\\u00e3o de Ecologia, da Editora Express\\u00e3o. A iniciativa vem sendo replicada em outras regi\\u00f5es, por meio de institui\\u00e7\\u00f5es que procuram a Cocari para levar o projeto para os seus munic\\u00edpios.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>O desenvolvimento desse projeto contribui para a melhoria da qualidade de vida dos cooperados, respeitando o meio ambiente e o uso consciente e sustent\\u00e1vel dos recursos naturais. \\u00c9 uma a\\u00e7\\u00e3o em total sintonia com os pilares da sustentabilidade, sendo socialmente justa, ambientalmente respons\\u00e1vel e economicamente vi\\u00e1vel.<\\/p>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 22:55:33\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-11 22:56:18\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-11 22:55:33\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 22:55:33\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":2,\"ordering\":0,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"*\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0);
