de respons\\u00e1vel pela organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o do certame, e pescadores de diversas cidades do Paran\\u00e1, o Comit\\u00ea de Sustentabilidade da Sicredi Grandes Lagos promoveu a soltura de alevinos no alagado de Rio Bonito do Igua\\u00e7u.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Durante o evento, 12 mil alevinos \\u2013 peixes juvenis, rec\\u00e9m-eclodidos dos ovos \\u2013 foram soltos no local, com o objetivo de revitalizar a fauna do lago e revitalizar as esp\\u00e9cies que vivem no local.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>As iniciativas ESG da Sicredi Grandes Lagos almejam beneficiar a natureza assim como as pessoas. \\u201cEssas a\\u00e7\\u00f5es est\\u00e3o conectadas \\u00e0s estrat\\u00e9gias da cooperativa em prol de desenvolver a comunidade\\u201d, conclui Maria Nivete Presa.<\\/p>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 23:34:03\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-11 23:34:40\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-11 23:34:03\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 23:34:03\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1677432955-scaled-800x420.jpeg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1677432955-scaled-800x420.jpeg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\