(183, 'com_content.article.109', '', '2024-10-12 00:33:29', 994, 1672, '983c7e47f11172321d0679374c5ed518b6f02e03', '{\"id\":109,\"asset_id\":232,\"title\":\"Painel 4\",\"alias\":\"painel-4\",\"introtext\":\"<p>The contribution of Social and Solidarity Economy to the SDGs: the role of trade policy<\\/p>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":9,\"created\":\"2024-10-12 00:33:29\",\"created_by\":994,\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-12 00:33:29\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":null,\"checked_out_time\":null,\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-12 00:33:29\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":\"1\",\"ordering\":null,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"*\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0),
(184, 'com_content.article.59', '', '2024-10-12 12:12:07', 994, 4675, 'be2f4f216d514373ed21fde15f0beb1081b2f016', '{\"id\":\"59\",\"asset_id\":182,\"title\":\"Restaura\\u00e7\\u00e3o e preserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o de nascentes\",\"alias\":\"restauracao-e-preservacao-de-nascentes\",\"introtext\":\"<p><strong>Projeto Olho d\\u00b4\\u00c1gua da Cocari restaura e preserva nascentes nas propriedades dos seus cooperados<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Lan\\u00e7ado em 24 de novembro de 2009, quando \\u00e9 comemorado o Dia do Rio, o projeto Olho d\\u00b4\\u00c1gua j\\u00e1 recuperou mais de 1.070 nascentes nas regi\\u00f5es de atua\\u00e7\\u00e3o da Cocari, cooperativa presente nos estados do Paran\\u00e1, Goi\\u00e1s e Minas Gerais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A partir da restaura\\u00e7\\u00e3o das minas, que aumenta a vaz\\u00e3o das nascentes, o produtor passa a ter \\u00e1gua sempre limpa, protegida contra enxurrada, eros\\u00e3o, fezes e urina de animais, para consumo e para atividades agropecu\\u00e1rias.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A restaura\\u00e7\\u00e3o das nascentes \\u00e9 feita com base em estudos para garantir a qualidade da \\u00e1gua. Da estrutura de solo cimento s\\u00e3o disponibilizados canos que podem ser conectados \\u00e0s mangueiras que ir\\u00e3o abastecer reservat\\u00f3rios d\\u00b4\\u00e1gua, que, por sua vez, ir\\u00e3o abastecer os lares e as atividades dos cooperados. A restaura\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\u00e9 realizada pelo t\\u00e9cnico Dorival Silvestre dos Santos, que est\\u00e1 \\u00e0 frente do projeto desde o in\\u00edcio e \\u00e9 o respons\\u00e1vel pelas mais de 1.070 restaura\\u00e7\\u00f5es j\\u00e1 realizadas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>O projeto conta com a parceria da empresa Nortox e com o apoio dos governos estaduais, por meio da Secretaria de Estado do Meio Ambiente e Recursos H\\u00eddricos, do Instituto \\u00c1gua e Terra e do Instituto de Desenvolvimento Rural (IDR).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Os cadastros das nascentes para recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\u00e9 feito por meio dos consultores t\\u00e9cnicos da Cocari em visita \\u00e0s propriedades ou diretamente nas Unidades da Cocari.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>O Projeto Olho D\\u2019\\u00c1gua tem recebido diversos pr\\u00eamios pela contribui\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental. Em 2014, foi apresentado no Minist\\u00e9rio da Agricultura, em Bras\\u00edlia, como refer\\u00eancia em publica\\u00e7\\u00e3o que elencou as a\\u00e7\\u00f5es ambientais mais importantes em andamento no Brasil naquele ano. A a\\u00e7\\u00e3o tamb\\u00e9m recebe o Selo Chico Mendes desde 2014 e conquistou o Trof\\u00e9u Cooperativa do Ano, em premia\\u00e7\\u00e3o da Organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o das Cooperativas Brasileiras (OCB). Em 2019, recebeu o trof\\u00e9u Onda Verde \\u2013 Pr\\u00eamio Express\\u00e3o de Ecologia, da Editora Express\\u00e3o. A iniciativa vem sendo replicada em outras regi\\u00f5es, por meio de institui\\u00e7\\u00f5es que procuram a Cocari para levar o projeto para os seus munic\\u00edpios.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>O desenvolvimento desse projeto contribui para a melhoria da qualidade de vida dos cooperados, respeitando o meio ambiente e o uso consciente e sustent\\u00e1vel dos recursos naturais. \\u00c9 uma a\\u00e7\\u00e3o em total sintonia com os pilares da sustentabilidade, sendo socialmente justa, ambientalmente respons\\u00e1vel e economicamente vi\\u00e1vel.<\\/p>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 22:55:33\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-12 12:12:07\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-12 12:11:24\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 22:55:33\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/Imagem1.jpg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/Imagem1.jpg?width=567&height=378\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":4,\"ordering\":26,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":1,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"*\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0),
(185, 'com_content.article.5', '', '2024-10-12 15:19:50', 994, 1754, '4a5e92a214dabf75524427e27d6ffbf2f0b59e0f', '{\"id\":\"5\",\"asset_id\":110,\"title\":\"Painel 1\",\"alias\":\"evento-1\",\"introtext\":\"<p>Prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o, Promo\\u00e7\\u00e3o e Participa\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Povos e Comunidades Tradicionais na constru\\u00e7\\u00e3o da agenda clim\\u00e1tica global<\\/p>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":9,\"created\":\"2024-10-09 02:04:49\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-12 15:19:50\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-12 15:19:47\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-09 02:04:49\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_a