(390, 'com_content.article.148', '', '2024-10-15 23:39:58', 994, 7022, 'fd5dcf4846cfe085a02ee7e7813b2aecbac1157b', '{\"id\":148,\"asset_id\":275,\"title\":\"Sicredi investe em intelig\\u00eancia e tecnologia para apoiar iniciativas sustent\\u00e1veis (2)\",\"alias\":\"sicredi-investe-em-inteligencia-e-tecnologia-para-apoiar-iniciativas-sustentaveis-2\",\"introtext\":\"<div class=\\\"col-lg-9 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"meio\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n<p>O compromisso do Sicredi com a pauta sustent\\u00e1vel n\\u00e3o \\u00e9 novidade. A cooperativa tem mais de 120 anos de hist\\u00f3ria e, apesar de ter sido criada para atender demandas financeiras, consolidou-se como refer\\u00eancia no apoio a projetos que fomentam o desenvolvimento sustent\\u00e1vel no pa\\u00eds.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Hoje, o Sicredi \\u00e9 o segundo maior financiador de cr\\u00e9dito rural do Brasil e acredita que o agroneg\\u00f3cio pode transformar o mundo para melhor. Com a meta de apoiar pequenos agricultores a valorizarem seus produtos e melhorarem suas condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es de trabalho, o Sicredi desenvolveu um plano multidisciplinar dividido em tr\\u00eas etapas \\u2013 as quais explicamos a seguir.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Metodologia Sicredi de apoio aos pequenos agricultores<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Basicamente, a primeira etapa, conectada ao DNA da cooperativa, envolve a\\u00e7\\u00f5es de desenvolvimento das comunidades locais e o fomento a finan\\u00e7as verdes. Na pr\\u00e1tica, significa oferecer condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es ben\\u00e9ficas para que o pequeno produtor consiga investir em materiais, sistemas e equipamentos que melhorem suas safras, sempre priorizando uma produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o sustent\\u00e1vel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Extremamente estrat\\u00e9gica, a segunda etapa envolve o uso de intelig\\u00eancia artificial e dados geoespaciais para garantir que os projetos apoiados estejam de acordo com as prerrogativas legais de acesso ao cr\\u00e9dito.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Varreduras de propriedades s\\u00e3o feitas a partir do CAR (Cadastro Ambiental Rural) para entender as necessidades dos associados e conferir se tudo est\\u00e1 de acordo com o que \\u00e9 previsto pela legisla\\u00e7\\u00e3o e pelos padr\\u00f5es de qualidade do Sicredi.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Na terceira etapa, a sustentabilidade se torna ainda mais presente. A ideia \\u00e9 mapear ambientes para entender quais contam com reservas legais excedentes ou \\u00e1reas de preserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o degradadas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Se o produtor atua em \\u00e1reas que est\\u00e3o de acordo com as normas de preserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o, os incentivos s\\u00e3o fornecidos para ajudar a mant\\u00ea-las dessa forma. Se forem identificados pontos que exigem recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o, o aux\\u00edlio financeiro \\u00e9 encaminhado para isso.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Equipe multidisciplinar e tecnologia<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Em resumo, todas essas etapas s\\u00e3o desenvolvidas por uma equipe multidisciplinar de profissionais especializados em intelig\\u00eancia geoespacial, contemplados por ge\\u00f3grafos, engenheiros agr\\u00f4nomos, cientistas da computa\\u00e7\\u00e3o, entre outros.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Essa equipe apoia na valida\\u00e7\\u00e3o e an\\u00e1lises de dados geoespaciais dos cadastros ambientais rurais e \\u00e1reas de import\\u00e2ncia ambiental. E essas bases de dados passam a fazer parte do sistema de contrata\\u00e7\\u00e3o de cr\\u00e9dito da cooperativa.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Tamb\\u00e9m \\u00e9 clara a import\\u00e2ncia e presen\\u00e7a da tecnologia em todos os processos. Isso porque \\u201co Sicredi investe em novas tecnologias em prol do desenvolvimento de pr\\u00e1ticas sustent\\u00e1veis que apoiam os associados\\u201d, ressalta Carla Moreira Melo, Analista de Dados Geo do Sicredi.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Al\\u00e9m disso, o Sicredi faz parte do hub AgTech Garage, que busca a inova\\u00e7\\u00e3o tecnol\\u00f3gica de atividades sustent\\u00e1veis aplicada \\u00e0 realidade do associado Sicredi. \\u201cTamb\\u00e9m contamos com consultorias externas para identificar o score de sustentabilidade dos empreendimentos beneficiados\\u201d, completa Carla.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>A quest\\u00e3o ambiental acima de tudo<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Al\\u00e9m de tornar as comunidades mais ambientalmente respons\\u00e1veis, o objetivo da iniciativa \\u00e9 tamb\\u00e9m o atendimento de requisitos m\\u00ednimos do C\\u00f3digo Florestal Brasileiro. Assim, a partir do Cadastro Ambiental Rural, validado pelo Sicar (Sistema Nacional de Cadastro Ambiental Rural), \\u00e9 poss\\u00edvel que o associado obtenha benef\\u00edcios na concess\\u00e3o de cr\\u00e9dito, o que instiga o associado a buscar a regularidade ambiental.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Vale ressaltar que o produtor rural atendendo ao C\\u00f3digo Florestal Brasileiro, ele est\\u00e1 preservando as matas nativas e seus estoques de carbono, al\\u00e9m de fornecer um ecossistema mais equilibrado para a manuten\\u00e7\\u00e3o da biodiversidade.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>E quando ocorre a identifica\\u00e7\\u00e3o de \\u00e1reas degradadas, o Sicredi apoia a recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o atrav\\u00e9s de linhas de cr\\u00e9dito com fonte de recursos do BNDES (Banco Nacional de Desenvolvimento Econ\\u00f4mico e Social). Nesse sentido, a cooperativa informa tamb\\u00e9m que novos produtos est\\u00e3o sendo desenvolvidos para apoiar a recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o de \\u00e1reas degradadas que foram alvo de embargos ambientais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-lg-3 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"fichaTecnica\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 23:41:27\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-15 23:39:54\",\"modified_by\":\"994\",\"checked_out\":null,\"checked_out_time\":null,\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 23:41:27\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1919349569-scaled-800x420.jpg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1919349569-scaled-800x420.jpg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":1,\"ordering\":null,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"en-GB\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0),
(391, 'com_content.article.148', '', '2024-10-15 23:40:15', 994, 6379, '62989f826b762a8b54682b9c277648bf76868273', '{\"id\":\"148\",\"asset_id\":275,\"title\":\"Sicredi invests in intelligence and technology to support sustainable initiatives\",\"alias\":\"sicredi-invests-in-intelligence-and-technology-to-support-sustainable-initiatives\",\"introtext\":\"<div class=\\\"col-lg-9 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"meio\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n<p>Sicredi\\u2019s commitment to the sustainability agenda is not new. The cooperative has over 120 years of history and, despite being created to address financial demands, has established itself as a reference in supporting projects that promote sustainable development in Brazil.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Today, Sicredi is the second-largest financing institution for rural credit in Brazil and believes that agribusiness can transform the world for the better. With the goal of supporting small farmers in increasing the value of their products and improving their working conditions, Sicredi has developed a multidisciplinary plan divided into three stages, which we explain below.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Sicredi\\u2019s Methodology to Support Small Farmers<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The first stage, which is connected to the cooperative\\u2019s DNA, involves actions for the development of local communities and the promotion of green finance. In practice, it means offering favorable conditions for small producers to invest in materials, systems, and equipment that enhance their crops, always prioritizing sustainable production.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Extremely strategic, the second stage involves the use of artificial intelligence and geospatial data to ensure that the supported projects comply with the legal requirements for credit access.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Property scans are conducted using the Rural Environmental Registry (CAR, in portuguese) to understand the needs of the members of the cooperative and verify compliance with legal requirements and Sicredi\\u2019s quality standards.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In the third stage, sustainability becomes even more prominent. The idea is to map areas to understand which of them have surplus legal reserves or degraded preservation areas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>If the producer operates in areas in accordance with preservation norms, incentives are provided to help maintain them. If areas requiring recovery are identified, financial assistance is directed toward that goal.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Multidisciplinary Team and Technology<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>In summary, all these stages are developed by a multidisciplinary team of professionals that specialize in geospatial intelligence, including geographers, agronomists, computer scientists, among others.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This team supports the validation and analysis of geospatial data from rural environmental registries and areas of environmental relevance. These databases then become part of the cooperative\\u2019s credit approval system.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>It\\u2019s clear how important and prevalent technology is in all these processes. This is because \\u201cSicredi invests in new technologies for the development of sustainable practices that support its members,\\u201d says Carla Moreira Melo, Geo Data Analyst at Sicredi.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Additionally, Sicredi is part of the AgTech Garage hub, which seeks technological innovation in sustainable activities applied to the reality of Sicredi\\u2019s members. \\u201cWe also rely on external consultants to identify the sustainability score of the supported enterprises,\\u201d adds Carla.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>The Environmental Issue Above All Else<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Apart from making communities more environmentally responsible, the initiative\\u2019s goal is also to meet the minimum requirements of the Brazilian Forest Code \\u2013 a legal framework that establishes rules for the use and preservation of forests and other forms of vegetation in Brazil. Thus, based on the Rural Environmental Registry, validated by Sicar (acronym in Portuguese for National Rural Environmental Registry System), members can obtain benefits in credit concessions, which encourages them to seek environmental compliance.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>It is noteworthy that by complying with the Brazilian Forest Code, the rural producer is preserving native forests and their carbon stocks, aside from contributing to a more balanced ecosystem for biodiversity maintenance.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>When degraded areas are identified, Sicredi supports recovery through credit lines with funding from the National Bank for Economic and Social Development (BNDES, in Portuguese). In this regard, the cooperative is working to develop new products to support the restoration of degraded areas that have been subject to environmental embargoes.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 23:41:27\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-15 23:40:15\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-15 23:40:00\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 23:41:27\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1919349569-scaled-800x420.jpg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/shutterstock_1919349569-scaled-800x420.jpg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":2,\"ordering\":0,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"en-GB\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0),
(392, 'com_content.article.149', '', '2024-10-15 23:40:37', 994, 7602, '6414fa3e9650e1490fc99d17e69e0edae8493215', '{\"id\":149,\"asset_id\":276,\"title\":\"Cresol Minas Gerais protege nascentes e o ecossistema de Espera Feliz (2)\",\"alias\":\"cresol-minas-gerais-protege-nascentes-e-o-ecossistema-de-espera-feliz-2\",\"introtext\":\"<div class=\\\"col-lg-9 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"meio\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n<p>A busca por \\u00e1gua pot\\u00e1vel e saneamento \\u00e9 uma prioridade global, refletida no Objetivo de Desenvolvimento Sustent\\u00e1vel (ODS) n\\u00famero 6. O tema \\u00e9 prioridade, tamb\\u00e9m, para a Cresol Minas Gerais em apoio ao desenvolvimento sustent\\u00e1vel das comunidades.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Em parceria com o Sindicato dos Trabalhadores da Agricultura Familiar de Espera Feliz, no estado de Minas Gerais, a cooperativa liderou o Projeto de Recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o e Revitaliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Nascentes na zona rural do munic\\u00edpio, que come\\u00e7ou em novembro de 2021 e perdurou at\\u00e9 maio de 2022. A parceria com o sindicato foi firmada a partir de um edital lan\\u00e7ado pela Cresol Minas Gerais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cO Sindicato \\u00e9 um importante parceiro das fam\\u00edlias rurais do munic\\u00edpio, logo a Cresol entendeu que, por meio da parceria, seria poss\\u00edvel beneficiar as fam\\u00edlias da regi\\u00e3o com a manuten\\u00e7\\u00e3o da \\u00e1gua pot\\u00e1vel que as abastece\\u201d, conta May\\u00e1 Patr\\u00edcia Polo, Analista de Relacionamento do Cresol Instituto.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Al\\u00e9m do sindicato, a iniciativa contou com o apoio de outras entidades p\\u00fablicas e privadas, tais como a Secretaria de Agricultura, Coofeliz, Fetraf MG, Capara\\u00f3 Jr, R\\u00e1dio Caf\\u00e9 FM, Centr\\u00e3o Materiais de Constru\\u00e7\\u00e3o, Associa\\u00e7\\u00e3o ASEAF, Constrular Materiais de Constru\\u00e7\\u00e3o e Agrotec Consultoria.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-large wp-image-601\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-1024x840.jpg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-1024x840.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-300x246.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-768x630.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1.jpg 1280w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"770\\\" height=\\\"632\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Protegendo nascentes<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>O Projeto de Recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o e Revitaliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Nascentes em Espera Feliz contou com um grande apoio da comunidade local. As propriedades contempladas para integrar o projeto foram indicadas pelo sindicato e avaliadas pela Cresol Minas Gerais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ao todo, 21 propriedades de agricultores familiares das comunidades da Bacia do Rio Itabapoana foram atendidas. \\u201cEsta iniciativa impactou diretamente mais de 100 fam\\u00edlias, proporcionando a elas um acesso mais seguro e confi\\u00e1vel \\u00e0 \\u00e1gua pot\\u00e1vel\\u201d, informa May\\u00e1 Patr\\u00edcia Polo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>As nascentes cumprem uma fun\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental muito importante, fornecendo \\u00e1gua para o consumo local, abastecimento de rios e lagos e ainda s\\u00e3o a fonte de vida para uma s\\u00e9rie de organismos importantes para o funcionamento dos ecossistemas ecol\\u00f3gicos \\u2013 o que envolve a fauna e a flora dos arredores.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-large wp-image-600\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-1024x682.jpg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8.jpg 1280w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"770\\\" height=\\\"513\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Ecossistema<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>O ecossistema ambiental saud\\u00e1vel melhora as condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es para a produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o agropecu\\u00e1ria familiar sustent\\u00e1vel, beneficiando os produtores locais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Para garantir a sa\\u00fade das nascentes, \\u00e9 importante proteg\\u00ea-las, evitando a contamina\\u00e7\\u00e3o com lixo, esgoto e outros elementos poluentes. Al\\u00e9m disso, tratar uma nascente polu\\u00edda \\u00e9 muito mais caro do que proteger sua integridade.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Isso acontece porque h\\u00e1 uma rela\\u00e7\\u00e3o estreita entre a preserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental e a disponibilidade de \\u00e1gua. A tese mais aceita diz que florestas, matas e ambientes preservados cumprem, entre outras fun\\u00e7\\u00f5es, a de manter um abastecimento constante de \\u00e1gua de boa qualidade, segundo o relat\\u00f3rio\\u00a0<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/chrome-extension\\/\\/efaidnbmnnnibpcajpcglclefindmkaj\\/https:\\/\\/www.terrabrasilis.org.br\\/ecotecadigital\\/pdf\\/nascentes-do-brasil-estrategias-para-a-protecao-de-cabeceiras-em-bacias-hidrograficas.pdf\\\">Nascentes do Brasil: Estrat\\u00e9gias para a Prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Cabeceiras em Bacias Hidrogr\\u00e1ficas<\\/a>, elaborado pela WWF Brasil.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Vale ressaltar que a recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o e revitaliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de nascentes por meio do plantio de matas ciliares contribui tamb\\u00e9m para o aumento do estoque de carbono nessas \\u00e1reas, configurando-se, portanto, uma ferramenta importante para o alcance da neutralidade de carbono nesses locais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Em resumo, o Projeto de Recupera\\u00e7\\u00e3o e Revitaliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Nascentes \\u00e9 uma forma de a Cresol Minas Gerais dar suporte \\u00e0 preserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental e desenvolvimento sustent\\u00e1vel das comunidades locais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-lg-3 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"fichaTecnica\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 23:42:35\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-15 23:40:34\",\"modified_by\":\"994\",\"checked_out\":null,\"checked_out_time\":null,\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 23:42:35\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/image6-800x420.jpg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/image6-800x420.jpg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":1,\"ordering\":null,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"en-GB\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0),
(393, 'com_content.article.149', '', '2024-10-15 23:40:55', 994, 6948, '4295e0137830cf238f5c783b8d0db6311a7e7f09', '{\"id\":\"149\",\"asset_id\":276,\"title\":\"Cresol Minas Gerais protects springs and the ecosystem of Espera Feliz\",\"alias\":\"cresol-minas-gerais-protects-springs-and-the-ecosystem-of-espera-feliz\",\"introtext\":\"<div class=\\\"col-lg-9 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"meio\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n<p>The search for clean water and sanitation is a global priority, reflected in the Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) number 6. It is also a priority for Cresol Minas Gerais, in support of sustainable development in local communities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In partnership with the Union of Family Agriculture Workers of Espera Feliz, in the Brazilian state of Minas Gerais, the cooperative led the Springs Recovery and Revitalization Project in the rural area of the municipality, which started in November 2021 and lasted until May 2022. The partnership with the Union was established through a call launched by Cresol Minas Gerais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cThe Union is an important partner for rural families in the municipality, so Cresol realized that through the partnership, it would be possible to benefit the families in the region by working on the maintenance of their clean water supply,\\u201d says May\\u00e1 Patr\\u00edcia Polo, Relationship Analyst at Cresol Instituto.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In addition to the Union, the initiative received support from other public and private entities, such as the local Department of Agriculture, Coofeliz, Fetraf MG, Capara\\u00f3 Jr, R\\u00e1dio Caf\\u00e9 FM, Centr\\u00e3o Materiais de Constru\\u00e7\\u00e3o, ASEAF Association, Constrular Materiais de Constru\\u00e7\\u00e3o, and Agrotec Consultoria.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-large wp-image-648\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-1024x840.jpg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-1024x840.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-300x246.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1-768x630.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image1.jpg 1280w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"770\\\" height=\\\"632\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Protecting springs<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The Springs Recovery and Revitalization Project in Espera Feliz received significant support from the local community. The properties selected to be part of the project were indicated by the Union and evaluated by Cresol Minas Gerais.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In total, the project served 21 properties of family farmers from the communities of the Itabapoana River Basin. \\u201cThis initiative directly helped over 100 families, providing them with safer and more reliable access to clean water,\\u201d May\\u00e1 Patr\\u00edcia Polo says.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The springs play a crucial environmental role, supplying water for local consumption, replenishing rivers and lakes, and serving as a source of life for a variety of organisms that are essential to the functioning of ecological ecosystems \\u2013 including the fauna and flora of the surroundings.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-large wp-image-649\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-1024x682.jpg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/image8.jpg 1280w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"770\\\" height=\\\"513\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Ecosystem<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>A healthy environmental ecosystem improves conditions for sustainable family agriculture, benefiting local producers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>To ensure that the springs remain healthy, it is important to protect them, avoiding contamination with waste, sewage, and other polluting elements. Moreover, treating a polluted spring is much more expensive than protecting its integrity before contamination.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This happens because there is a close relationship between environmental preservation and water availability. The most accepted thesis suggests that preserved forests, woods, and environments play a role in maintaining a constant supply of good-quality water, according to the report \\u201cNascentes do Brasil: Estrat\\u00e9gias para a Prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o de Cabeceiras em Bacias Hidrogr\\u00e1ficas\\u201d (translated as \\u201cSprings of Brazil: Strategies for the Protection of Headwaters in Watersheds\\u201d), produced by WWF Brasil.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>It is worth noting that the recovery and revitalization of springs through the planting of riparian forests also contribute to increasing the carbon stock in these areas, thus serving as an important tool for achieving carbon neutrality in these locations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>To sum up, the Springs Recovery and Revitalization Project is a way for Cresol Minas Gerais to support environmental preservation and sustainable development in local communities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 23:42:35\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-15 23:40:55\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-15 23:40:39\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 23:42:35\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/image6-800x420.jpg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/image6-800x420.jpg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":2,\"ordering\":0,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"en-GB\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0),
(394, 'com_content.article.150', '', '2024-10-15 23:41:42', 994, 8534, '132553eca22a141a8f1ff1939ba0092cf65a101e', '{\"id\":150,\"asset_id\":277,\"title\":\"Com o Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem, Unicred Ponto Capital pratica economia circular t\\u00eaxtil (2)\",\"alias\":\"com-o-batalhao-do-bem-unicred-ponto-capital-pratica-economia-circular-textil-2\",\"introtext\":\"<div class=\\\"col-lg-9 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"meio\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n<p>A economia circular \\u00e9 uma das grandes tend\\u00eancias para construir comunidades mais sustent\\u00e1veis e, ao mesmo tempo, proporcionar trabalho e renda. Essa \\u00e9 a motiva\\u00e7\\u00e3o que guia o Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem, uma iniciativa liderada pela cooperativa de cr\\u00e9dito Unicred Ponto Capital, atuante no Sul e no Nordeste do pa\\u00eds.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Com apoio do Instituto Unicred, a Unicred Ponto Capital idealizou um projeto focado em reutilizar res\\u00edduos t\\u00eaxteis oriundos de fardas e vestimentas descartadas por unidades militares na regi\\u00e3o de Santa Maria, no estado do Rio Grande do Sul. A a\\u00e7\\u00e3o teve in\\u00edcio em mar\\u00e7o de 2023.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>O projeto reconhece a import\\u00e2ncia de maximizar o valor dos recursos existentes e minimizar o desperd\\u00edcio. O ciclo de vida das indument\\u00e1rias militares \\u00e9 prolongado por meio de v\\u00e1rias etapas bem definidas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cOs objetivos do projeto s\\u00e3o pautados no incentivo \\u00e0 economia circular, forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o e profissionaliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de artes\\u00e3s, doa\\u00e7\\u00e3o de pe\\u00e7as em bom estado para recicladores e impactar positivamente a comunidade beneficiada alinhado aos princ\\u00edpios cooperativistas\\u201d, explica Wellinton Henrique Azambuja Martins, Assessor Executivo de Governan\\u00e7a da Unicred Ponto Capital.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-full wp-image-611\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-20.jpeg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-20.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-20-300x266.jpeg 300w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"768\\\" height=\\\"682\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Opera\\u00e7\\u00e3o circular<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>O material doado pelos militares passa por uma an\\u00e1lise criteriosa, onde a qualidade e viabilidade de reaproveitamento s\\u00e3o avaliadas. A sele\\u00e7\\u00e3o de pe\\u00e7as que podem ser reaproveitadas e aquelas que n\\u00e3o est\\u00e3o mais em condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es de uso segue o conceito de efici\\u00eancia na utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de recursos.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cO projeto consiste no reaproveitamento de res\\u00edduos t\\u00eaxteis que ora eram incinerados ou tinham um descarte inadequado, prejudicando o meio ambiente\\u201d, explica Martins. As pe\\u00e7as em bom estado passam por um processo de revitaliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o e tingimento. Em seguida, elas s\\u00e3o doadas \\u00e0 comunidade.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>J\\u00e1 as vestimentas que n\\u00e3o podem ser reutilizadas, por outro lado, t\\u00eam um destino diferente, conta Martins. \\u201cElas viram mat\\u00e9ria prima para customiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o e transforma\\u00e7\\u00e3o e em produtos que podem ser comercializados pelas alunas dos cursos que o projeto oferece, sendo um complemento na renda dessas pessoas e dando um destino mais sustent\\u00e1vel para o que seria descartado\\u201d.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ao todo, mais de 2.000 pe\\u00e7as e 600 pares de cal\\u00e7ados foram doados para ONGs e Associa\\u00e7\\u00f5es que trabalham com reciclagem, bem como outras entidades carentes que recebem agasalhos. Al\\u00e9m disso, 500 pe\\u00e7as passaram pelo processo de descaracteriza\\u00e7\\u00e3o e reaproveitamento.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Para o meio ambiente, o Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem contribui na redu\\u00e7\\u00e3o do consumo de \\u00e1gua, energia, agrot\\u00f3xicos e produtos qu\\u00edmicos pelo setor t\\u00eaxtil. Ademais, a iniciativa tamb\\u00e9m proporciona a diminui\\u00e7\\u00e3o de gases do efeito estufa, uma vez que reduz a necessidade de produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o de novas pe\\u00e7as.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-large wp-image-605\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-1024x879.jpeg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-1024x879.jpeg 1024w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-300x258.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-768x659.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22.jpeg 1200w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"770\\\" height=\\\"661\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Parcerias em prol da educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>O Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem tamb\\u00e9m proporciona oportunidades de educa\\u00e7\\u00e3o e gera\\u00e7\\u00e3o de renda para a comunidade local. Por meio de parcerias com diversas institui\\u00e7\\u00f5es p\\u00fablicas, empresas mercantis e outras cooperativas, o projeto tem seu bra\\u00e7o educacional.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dessa forma, o Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem realiza os cursos de Customiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o (carga hor\\u00e1ria de 40h), Microempreendedorismo (carga hor\\u00e1ria de 40h) e Reciclador Profissional (carga hor\\u00e1ria de 120h). Investimentos do Fundo Social Sescoop\\/RS, dedicado a apoiar projetos ESG que contribuem para os Objetivos de Desenvolvimento Sustent\\u00e1vel (ODSs), possibilitaram a oferta dos cursos, que contam com mais de 80% de participa\\u00e7\\u00e3o feminina.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cUm grande desafio foi engajar as alunas do projeto e terem frequ\\u00eancia para conclus\\u00e3o do curso. Para isso, em parceria com a Prefeitura Municipal de Santa Maria, o projeto disponibilizou transporte de ida e volta para deslocamentos das alunas em dia de curso, al\\u00e9m da alimenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o que foi ofertada desde o in\\u00edcio do projeto\\u201d, diz Martins.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Os impactos positivos do projeto se estendem tanto para a comunidade local quanto para o ambiente em larga escala, trazendo benef\\u00edcios econ\\u00f4micos e ambientais tang\\u00edveis para todos, aponta Martins, que conta os pr\\u00f3ximos planos para o Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cPara o futuro, o projeto pretende receber mais tecidos excedentes, agora de diversos outros parceiros que desejam dar um destino mais sustent\\u00e1vel aos seus res\\u00edduos t\\u00eaxteis. Al\\u00e9m disso, as iniciativas educacionais ser\\u00e3o focadas em corte e costura, tanto costura b\\u00e1sica, quanto de alta costura e manuten\\u00e7\\u00e3o das m\\u00e1quinas, visando profissionalizar cada vez mais os alunos do projeto. A longo prazo, o Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem estuda formar uma cooperativa ou associa\\u00e7\\u00e3o voltada a essa finalidade\\u201d.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-lg-3 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"fichaTecnica\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 23:44:12\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-15 23:41:29\",\"modified_by\":\"994\",\"checked_out\":null,\"checked_out_time\":null,\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 23:44:12\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/IMAGEM-17-800x420.jpeg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/IMAGEM-17-800x420.jpeg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":1,\"ordering\":null,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"en-GB\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0),
(395, 'com_content.article.150', '', '2024-10-15 23:42:00', 994, 8108, '8492183eceed43d91bb80234f75c4fb62bfd16d4', '{\"id\":\"150\",\"asset_id\":277,\"title\":\"With the project \\u2018Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem\\u2019, Unicred Ponto Capital practices textile circular economy\",\"alias\":\"with-the-project-batalhao-do-bem-unicred-ponto-capital-practices-textile-circular-economy\",\"introtext\":\"<div class=\\\"col-lg-9 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"meio\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-lg-9 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"meio\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n<p>Circular economy is one of the major trends for building more sustainable communities while generating employment and income. This is the motivation behind the initiative \\u2018Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem\\u2019 (translated as \\u2018Battalion for Good\\u2019 in English), led by the credit union Unicred Ponto Capital, which operates in the South and Northeast of Brazil.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With the support of Unicred Institute, Unicred Ponto Capital conceived a project focused on reusing textile waste from uniforms and clothing discarded by military units in the Santa Maria region, in the state of Rio Grande do Sul. The action began in March 2023.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The project acknowledges the importance of maximizing the value of existing resources and minimizing waste. The lifecycle of military uniforms is extended through various well-defined stages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cThe project\\u2019s goals are based on promoting the circular economy, training and professionalizing artisans, donating pieces in good condition to recyclers, and positively impacting the community, in line with cooperative principles,\\u201d explains Wellinton Henrique Azambuja Martins, Executive Governance Advisor at Unicred Ponto Capital.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-full wp-image-653\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-20.jpeg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-20.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-20-300x266.jpeg 300w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"768\\\" height=\\\"682\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Circular Operation<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The material donated by the military undergoes a thorough analysis where the quality and feasibility of reuse are assessed. The selection of pieces that can be reused and those that are no longer in good conditions follows the principle of efficient resource use.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cThe project consists in reusing textile waste that previously would have been incinerated or improperly discarded, thus harming the environment,\\u201d Martins explains. Pieces of clothing in good condition undergo a revitalization and dyeing process. They are then donated to the community.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>On the other hand, garments that cannot be reused have a different fate, Martins adds. \\u201cThey become raw material for customization and transformation into products that can be sold by the students of the courses offered by the project, serving as a supplement to their income and providing a more sustainable destination for what would otherwise have been thrown away.\\u201d<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In total, more than 2,000 pieces of clothing and 600 pairs of shoes were donated to NGOs and recycling institutions, as well as other organizations that collect winter clothing. Additionally, 500 pieces underwent a process of reconfiguration and reuse.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For the environment, the \\u2018Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem\\u2019 contributes to reducing water, energy, pesticides, and chemical consumption in the textile sector. Furthermore, the initiative also helps decrease greenhouse gas emissions by reducing the need to produce new pieces.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img class=\\\"alignnone size-large wp-image-654\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-1024x879.jpeg\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-1024x879.jpeg 1024w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-300x258.jpeg 300w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22-768x659.jpeg 768w, https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/IMAGEM-22.jpeg 1200w\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"770\\\" height=\\\"661\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Partnerships for Education<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>\\u2018Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem\\u2019 also provides opportunities for education and income generation for the local community. Through partnerships with various public institutions, commercial enterprises, and other cooperatives, the project has an educational component.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This way, \\u2018Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem\\u2019 offers courses in Customization (40 hours), Entrepreneurship for Small Businesses (40 hours), and Professional Recycler (120 hours). Investments from the Sescoop\\/RS Social Fund, dedicated to supporting ESG projects that contribute to the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), allowed the initiative to offer courses in which over 80% of the participants were women.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cA significant challenge was engaging the project\\u2019s female students and ensuring their attendance for course completion. To address this, in partnership with the Municipal Government of Santa Maria, the project provided transportation for the students to and from the classrooms, as well as meals offered since the beginning of the project,\\u201d says Martins.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The positive impacts extend to both the local community and the environment on a large scale, bringing tangible economic and environmental benefits for everyone, Martins points out, outlining the upcoming plans for the \\u2018Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem\\u2019:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u201cFor the future, the project aims to receive more surplus fabrics, now from various other partners who wish to give a more sustainable destination to their textile waste. Additionally, educational initiatives will focus on cutting and sewing, both basic and haute couture, and machine maintenance, with the aim to further professionalize the students. In the long term, the \\u2018Batalh\\u00e3o do Bem\\u2019 is considering forming a cooperative or association dedicated to this purpose.\\u201d<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-lg-3 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"fichaTecnica\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":8,\"created\":\"2024-10-11 23:44:12\",\"created_by\":\"994\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-15 23:42:00\",\"modified_by\":994,\"checked_out\":994,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-15 23:41:45\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-11 23:44:12\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\\\\/IMAGEM-17-800x420.jpeg#joomlaImage:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/local-images\\\\\\/IMAGEM-17-800x420.jpeg?width=800&height=420\\\",\\\"image_intro_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_intro_caption\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"float_fulltext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_fulltext_caption\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"urls\":\"{\\\"urla\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlatext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targeta\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlbtext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetb\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlc\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urlctext\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"targetc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"attribs\":\"{\\\"article_layout\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_titles\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_tags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"info_block_show_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_parent_category\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_associations\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"flags\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"link_author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_create_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_modify_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publish_date\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_item_navigation\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_hits\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_noauth\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"urls_position\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"alternative_readmore\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"article_page_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_publishing_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_article_options\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_backend\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"show_urls_images_frontend\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"version\":2,\"ordering\":0,\"metakey\":\"\",\"metadesc\":\"\",\"access\":1,\"hits\":0,\"metadata\":\"{\\\"robots\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"rights\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"featured\":\"0\",\"language\":\"en-GB\",\"note\":\"\"}', 0);
