(513, 'com_content.article.197', '', '2024-10-22 19:27:25', 995, 63615, '08304573739948cb02afe60a3913bf1e5cda64cf', '{\"id\":\"197\",\"asset_id\":324,\"title\":\"COP29: the role of cooperatives in combating climate change\",\"alias\":\"cop29-the-role-of-cooperatives-in-combating-climate-change\",\"introtext\":\"<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A 29\\u00aa edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o da COP (Confer\\u00eancia das Na\\u00e7\\u00f5es Unidas sobre Mudan\\u00e7as Clim\\u00e1ticas) est\\u00e1 marcada para ocorrer entre os dias 11 e 22 de novembro em Baku, capital do Azerbaij\\u00e3o. O evento reunir\\u00e1 l\\u00edderes governamentais e representantes de organiza\\u00e7\\u00f5es da sociedade civil do mundo para discutir medidas contra o avan\\u00e7o do aquecimento global.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A \\u00faltima edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o da confer\\u00eancia revisada na assinatura de um acordo para redu\\u00e7\\u00e3o do uso de combust\\u00edveis f\\u00f3sseis, embora n\\u00e3o tenha prevista uma meta clara nem especificada o fim do seu uso. A expectativa \\u00e9 que a COP29 seja palco de debates sobre a transi\\u00e7\\u00e3o energ\\u00e9tica, com avan\\u00e7os e determina\\u00e7\\u00f5es sobre como os pa\\u00edses podem conduzir esse processo.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Uma das principais preocupa\\u00e7\\u00f5es do Azerbaij\\u00e3o, pa\\u00eds reunido, \\u00e9 conectar na\\u00e7\\u00f5es direcionadas e em desenvolvimento. O financiamento clim\\u00e1tico deve estar na pauta da COP29, definindo como as principais economias do planeta com desconto financeiramente para projetos sustent\\u00e1veis.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Al\\u00e9m disso, a meta global continua a mesma do Acordo de Paris, assinado em 2016: limitar o aquecimento global a 1,5\\u00baC acima dos n\\u00edveis pr\\u00e9-industriais at\\u00e9 2100.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Cooperativismo e COP29<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Atingir a meta contra o aquecimento global s\\u00f3 ser\\u00e1 poss\\u00edvel com a colabora\\u00e7\\u00e3o de todas as partes envolvidas. Assim como os governos precisam chegar a acordos e direcionar investimentos para a agenda ambiental, as empresas devem cumprir as normas e encontrar solu\\u00e7\\u00f5es que minimizem o impacto natural de suas atividades.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">O modelo cooperativo \\u00e9 perfeitamente adequado a essas necessidades. Seu princ\\u00edpio b\\u00e1sico \\u00e9 colaborar no desenvolvimento social, econ\\u00f4mico e ambiental das comunidades que atuam.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">As cooperativas t\\u00eam o dever de promover investimentos ambientalmente corretos e socialmente justos, alinhando-se assim aos Objetivos de Desenvolvimento Sustent\\u00e1vel (ODS) estabelecidos pela ONU. S\\u00e3o <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sdgs.un.org\\/goals\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">17 pontos de apelo \\u00e0 comunidade global<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> para proteger o meio ambiente e a humanidade.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">N\\u00e3o \\u00e9 incomum que projetos cooperativos se alinhem a pelo menos um ODS, aproximando-os assim das metas definidas pela COP29. Aqui est\\u00e3o oito iniciativas cooperativas que visam fazer sua parte para combater o aquecimento global.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><img src=\\\"ima