(574, 'com_content.article.197', '', '2024-10-30 12:05:37', 995, 63612, '7db5cb2424a325a54692d776fefb2b6f3a56a1e0', '{\"id\":\"197\",\"asset_id\":324,\"title\":\"COP29: the role of cooperatives in combating climate change\",\"alias\":\"cop29-the-role-of-cooperatives-in-combating-climate-change\",\"introtext\":\"<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A 29\\u00aa edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o da COP (Confer\\u00eancia das Na\\u00e7\\u00f5es Unidas sobre Mudan\\u00e7as Clim\\u00e1ticas) est\\u00e1 marcada para ocorrer entre os dias 11 e 22 de novembro em Baku, capital do Azerbaij\\u00e3o. O evento reunir\\u00e1 l\\u00edderes governamentais e representantes de organiza\\u00e7\\u00f5es da sociedade civil do mundo para discutir medidas contra o avan\\u00e7o do aquecimento global.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A \\u00faltima edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o da confer\\u00eancia revisada na assinatura de um acordo para redu\\u00e7\\u00e3o do uso de combust\\u00edveis f\\u00f3sseis, embora n\\u00e3o tenha prevista uma meta clara nem especificada o fim do seu uso. A expectativa \\u00e9 que a COP29 seja palco de debates sobre a transi\\u00e7\\u00e3o energ\\u00e9tica, com avan\\u00e7os e determina\\u00e7\\u00f5es sobre como os pa\\u00edses podem conduzir esse processo.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Uma das principais preocupa\\u00e7\\u00f5es do Azerbaij\\u00e3o, pa\\u00eds reunido, \\u00e9 conectar na\\u00e7\\u00f5es direcionadas e em desenvolvimento. O financiamento clim\\u00e1tico deve estar na pauta da COP29, definindo como as principais economias do planeta com desconto financeiramente para projetos sustent\\u00e1veis.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Al\\u00e9m disso, a meta global continua a mesma do Acordo de Paris, assinado em 2016: limitar o aquecimento global a 1,5\\u00baC acima dos n\\u00edveis pr\\u00e9-industriais at\\u00e9 2100.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Cooperativismo e COP29<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Atingir a meta contra o aquecimento global s\\u00f3 ser\\u00e1 poss\\u00edvel com a colabora\\u00e7\\u00e3o de todas as partes envolvidas. Assim como os governos precisam chegar a acordos e direcionar investimentos para a agenda ambiental, as empresas devem cumprir as normas e encontrar solu\\u00e7\\u00f5es que minimizem o impacto natural de suas atividades.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">O modelo cooperativo \\u00e9 perfeitamente adequado a essas necessidades. Seu princ\\u00edpio b\\u00e1sico \\u00e9 colaborar no desenvolvimento social, econ\\u00f4mico e ambiental das comunidades que atuam.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">As cooperativas t\\u00eam o dever de promover investimentos ambientalmente corretos e socialmente justos, alinhando-se assim aos Objetivos de Desenvolvimento Sustent\\u00e1vel (ODS) estabelecidos pela ONU. S\\u00e3o <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sdgs.un.org\\/goals\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">17 pontos de apelo \\u00e0 comunidade global<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> para proteger o meio ambiente e a humanidade.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">N\\u00e3o \\u00e9 incomum que projetos cooperativos se alinhem a pelo menos um ODS, aproximando-os assim das metas definidas pela COP29. Aqui est\\u00e3o oito iniciativas cooperativas que visam fazer sua parte para combater o aquecimento global.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><img src=\\\"images\\/Sicoob%20Aracoop2.png\\\" width=\\\"1000\\\" height=\\\"468\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" data-path=\\\"local-images:\\/Sicoob Aracoop2.png\\\"><\\/h3>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Sicredi e Sicoob Aracoop: recursos para prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Embora investir em projetos sustent\\u00e1veis \\u200b\\u200bpossa gerar economias de longo prazo, os recursos financeiros s\\u00e3o necess\\u00e1rios para que essas mudan\\u00e7as se concretizem. Facilitar o acesso ao cr\\u00e9dito para iniciativas verdes \\u00e9 uma forma de contribuir para o combate ao aquecimento global, e essa \\u00e9 uma das solu\\u00e7\\u00f5es encontradas pelo Sicredi.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Nesse sentido, <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/cases\\/sicredi-invests-in-intelligence-and-technology-to-support-sustainable-initiatives\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">o Sicredi oferece condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es ben\\u00e9ficas para que pequenos produtores rurais<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> invistam em materiais, sistemas e equipamentos que melhorem seus trabalhos de forma sustent\\u00e1vel. O apoio do Sicredi, no entanto, n\\u00e3o se limita aos cr\\u00e9ditos concedidos.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">O sistema de cooperativas de cr\\u00e9dito utiliza IA e dados geoespaciais para garantir que os projetos sigam as prerrogativas condicionais. H\\u00e1 tamb\\u00e9m mapeamento de propriedades, com o objetivo de identificar se \\u00e1reas atendem a padr\\u00f5es de preserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o. Ao incentivo ao cumprimento do C\\u00f3digo Florestal Brasileiro, o Sicredi est\\u00e1 ajudando a preservar as florestas e seus estoques de carbono.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A Sicoob Aracoop, cooperativa de cr\\u00e9dito com atua\\u00e7\\u00e3o em Minas Gerais e no Par\\u00e1, tamb\\u00e9m conta com modelos especiais para iniciativas sustent\\u00e1veis. Um dos projetos de maior destaque \\u00e9 o <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/cases\\/sicoob-aracoop-finances-photovoltaic-power-plant-in-minas-gerais\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">financiamento para a constru\\u00e7\\u00e3o da Usina Fotovoltaica da Associa\\u00e7\\u00e3o dos Usu\\u00e1rios do Projeto Pirapora (AUPPI)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> , que recebeu mais de R$ 3,2 milh\\u00f5es em investimentos.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Este \\u00e9, at\\u00e9 o momento, o maior projeto sustent\\u00e1vel financiado pelo Sicoob Aracoop. A planta auxilia a AUPPI a manter sua estrutura de seguran\\u00e7a em um importante centro frut\\u00edcola.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A cooperativa de cr\\u00e9dito analisa cada projeto detalhadamente do ponto de vista socioambiental. O Sicoob Aracoop trabalha com linhas de cr\\u00e9dito espec\\u00edficas para moderniza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de estruturas para torn\\u00e1-las menos poluentes, linhas sociais para regulariza\\u00e7\\u00e3o de pequenos empreendedores e linhas externas para investimentos em fontes de energia limpa, como \\u00e9 o caso da usina AUPPI.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Cogran e Frimesa: energia para transformar<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Quest\\u00e3o central para o desenvolvimento sustent\\u00e1vel, a transi\\u00e7\\u00e3o energ\\u00e9tica consiste na substitui\\u00e7\\u00e3o de combust\\u00edveis f\\u00f3sseis por alternativas limpas, que emitem pouco ou nenhum g\\u00e1s de efeito estufa. Essa iniciativa est\\u00e1 sendo colocada em pr\\u00e1tica na Cogran, a Cooperativa dos Granjeiros do Oeste de Minas.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Em 2010, <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/cases\\/the-energy-transition-makes-cograns-production-cleaner-and-greener\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">a Cogran iniciou um projeto para instalar biodigestores nos locais de produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o de seus membros<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> , obtendo assim tributa\\u00e7\\u00e3o. Hoje, v\\u00e1rias propriedades s\\u00e3o autossuficientes em energia, e algumas at\\u00e9 \\u00e0 venda.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A Cogran tamb\\u00e9m tem duas usinas de energia solar, uma instalada em uma loja e outra em uma f\\u00e1brica. A cooperativa busca expandir a instala\\u00e7\\u00e3o de usinas solares, progredir dentro dos par\\u00e2metros ESG e retornar ao mercado de cr\\u00e9ditos de carbono.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/cases\\/frimesa-is-a-benchmark-in-the-adoption-of-clean-energy\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A Frimesa \\u00e9 mais uma cooperativa rural na jornada rumo \\u00e0 produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o sustent\\u00e1vel de energia.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> A cooperativa tamb\\u00e9m tem investido na produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o de biog\\u00e1s por meio de biodigestores, instalados na planta industrial de Medianeira-PR. A planta tem capacidade para gerar cerca de 8.700 Nm\\u00b3\\/dia de biog\\u00e1s. A ideia \\u00e9 expandir uma estrutura para Assis Chateaubriand-PR.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Os biodigestores fazem parte do plano de cooperativa de uso de energia limpa e renov\\u00e1vel. A Frimesa tamb\\u00e9m investiu R$ 400 mil na instala\\u00e7\\u00e3o de uma usina de energia solar que gera uma economia anual de R$ 70 mil. O plano \\u00e9 neutralizar as emiss\\u00f5es de gases de efeito estufa de suas opera\\u00e7\\u00f5es industriais at\\u00e9 2040.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><img src=\\\"images\\/Centcoop.png\\\" width=\\\"820\\\" height=\\\"312\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" data-path=\\\"local-images:\\/Centcoop.png\\\"><\\/h3>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Cootravipa e Centcoop reciclam para construir um futuro melhor<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Usar recursos de forma inteligente, reciclar e reaproveitar objetos \\u00e9 outra etapa importante na dire\\u00e7\\u00e3o de um futuro mais sustent\\u00e1vel. Educar as pessoas sobre os res\\u00edduos que elas produzem ajuda a disseminar essas pr\\u00e1ticas. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/inova.coop.br\\/radar\\/cootravipa-desenvolve-app-para-monitorar-coleta-seletiva-e-educar-geradores-de-residuos-5ea35ea006bd\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">\\u00c9 nisso que a Cootravipa est\\u00e1 apostando.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A Cootravipa, do Rio Grande do Sul, desenvolveu o aplicativo Coleta Tri para monitorar a coleta coletada de res\\u00edduos e oferecer informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es relevantes e educativas aos seus geradores. A iniciativa trouxe resultados positivos, aumentando em mais de 30% a quantidade de res\\u00edduos produzidos e direcionados para unidades de triagem. O desenvolvimento do canal aberto tamb\\u00e9m impediu o n\\u00famero de reclama\\u00e7\\u00f5es \\u00e0 Cootravipa.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Proporcionar melhores condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es para quem trabalha com reciclagem tamb\\u00e9m \\u00e9 uma forma de desenvolvimento sustent\\u00e1vel. O Centcoop, Centro de Cooperativas de Trabalho com Materiais Recicl\\u00e1veis \\u200b\\u200bdo Distrito Federal, <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/negocios.coop.br\\/aprendamais\\/centcoop-melhores-condicoes-para-catadores-de-reciclaveis-por-meio-da-intercooperacao\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">alcan\\u00e7ou tais resultados por meio da coopera\\u00e7\\u00e3o entre cooperativas.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A Centrocoop, que re\\u00fane 21 cooperativas e associa\\u00e7\\u00f5es de catadores de materiais recicl\\u00e1veis, fechadas um lix\\u00e3o e constru\\u00edda um galp\\u00e3o, que atualmente \\u00e9 usada por 11 cooperativas e 460 trabalhadores.\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A Centcoop tamb\\u00e9m conseguiu incluir a previd\\u00eancia social dos catadores nos contratos governamentais e ajudou cooperativas a conquistar os melhores contratos de coleta seletiva no Distrito Federal.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">CAMTA e Expocacer: produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o agr\\u00edcola sustent\\u00e1vel<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Progresso econ\\u00f4mico e preserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o ambiental podem e devem andar de m\\u00e3os dadas. A CAMTA \\u00e9 um exemplo bem-sucedido disso. A <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/negocios.coop.br\\/aprendamais\\/camta-producao-sustentavel-garante-certificacoes-necessarias-para-ampliar-exportacao\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Cooperativa Agr\\u00edcola Mista Tom\\u00e9-A\\u00e7u tem um modelo \\u00fanico de agricultura sustent\\u00e1vel na Amaz\\u00f4nia.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">O Sistema Agroflorestal Tom\\u00e9-A\\u00e7u (SAFTA) tem caracter\\u00edsticas \\u00fanicas, como promover o crescimento do cacau em um ambiente sustent\\u00e1vel que simula uma floresta nativa. O CAMTA incentiva a dissemina\\u00e7\\u00e3o do sistema para seus associados, redu\\u00e7\\u00e3o do desmatamento e opera\\u00e7\\u00e3o em um ambiente agrad\\u00e1vel com \\u00e1rvores.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Em 2019, a cooperativa obteve o selo de Indica\\u00e7\\u00e3o Geogr\\u00e1fica, comprovando que o produto tem caracter\\u00edsticas \\u00fanicas devido ao seu local de origem. A certifica\\u00e7\\u00e3o ajuda a CAMTA a exportar cacau para mais pa\\u00edses, e ela j\\u00e1 tem mercados na Alemanha, Argentina, Estados Unidos, Fran\\u00e7a, Israel e Jap\\u00e3o.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Outra forma de produzir de forma sustent\\u00e1vel \\u00e9 por meio de t\\u00e9cnicas de agricultura regenerativa, que visa preservar a sa\\u00fade do solo, aumentar a biodiversidade, proteger os recursos h\\u00eddricos e promover a resili\\u00eancia dos sistemas agr\\u00edcolas. A Expocacer \\u00e9 refer\\u00eancia mundial nessa \\u00e1rea e se tornou a <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/inova.coop.br\\/radar\\/expocacer-e-a-primeira-coop-do-mundo-a-conquistar-selo-de-agricultura-regenerativa-0c32f29004fb\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">primeira cooperativa do mundo a receber o selo de certifica\\u00e7\\u00e3o regenerativa<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> pela organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o internacional Regenagri.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A obten\\u00e7\\u00e3o do selo tamb\\u00e9m levou em considera\\u00e7\\u00e3o as \\u00e1reas sociais e de governan\\u00e7a, nas quais a cooperativa foi aprovada com nota 100%. Outro aspecto considerado foi a implementa\\u00e7\\u00e3o da rastreabilidade do caf\\u00e9, do armaz\\u00e9m ao consumidor.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A classifica\\u00e7\\u00e3o se tornou um diferencial de mercado para a Expocacer. Seus produtos passaram a ser distribu\\u00eddos internacionalmente, levados pela marca italiana Illy Caff\\u00e8 para 50 pa\\u00edses ao redor do mundo.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Conclus\\u00e3o: cooperativas para o desenvolvimento sustent\\u00e1vel<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Os oito exemplos marcantes citados neste texto e muitos outros projetos realizados pelo Brasil mostram que as cooperativas est\\u00e3o trabalhando no prol do desenvolvimento sustent\\u00e1vel, caminhando na dire\\u00e7\\u00e3o almejada pela COP29 e obrigat\\u00f3ria para o combate eficaz ao aquecimento global.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Com tantos exemplos positivos, nada melhor para as cooperativas do que importamos com novos p\\u00fablicos. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.somoscooperativismo.coop.br\\/noticias-representacao\\/sistema-ocb-inicia-jornada-cooperativa-rumo-a-cop-29\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">A boa not\\u00edcia \\u00e9 que essa oportunidade existir\\u00e1 na COP29.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> Casos brasileiros ser\\u00e3o apresentados em pain\\u00e9is, locais ideais para troca de informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es sobre cooperativas e sustentabilidade.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Se voc\\u00ea quer saber mais sobre cases de sucesso, a Coopera\\u00e7\\u00e3o Ambiental \\u00e9 o site onde voc\\u00ea pode encontr\\u00e1-los! <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/cooperacaoambiental.coop.br\\/en\\/categoria\\/cases\\/\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Confira neste link<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"> exemplos de cooperativas de diferentes segmentos que desenvolvem projetos inovadores e sustent\\u00e1veis!<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"fulltext\":\"\",\"state\":\"1\",\"catid\":10,\"created\":\"2024-10-22 18:20:51\",\"created_by\":\"995\",\"created_by_alias\":\"\",\"modified\":\"2024-10-30 12:05:37\",\"modified_by\":995,\"checked_out\":995,\"checked_out_time\":\"2024-10-30 12:05:23\",\"publish_up\":\"2024-10-22 18:20:51\",\"publish_down\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"image_intro\\\":\\\"images\\\